{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25868","headline":"拜宣武军节度使 · 李绅","name":"拜宣武军节度使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"油幢竝入虎旗开，锦橐从天凤诏来。\n星应魏师新鼓角，地嫌梁苑旧池台。\n日晖红斾分如电，人拥青门动若雷。\n伊洛镜清回首处，是非纷杂任尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}